&lt;p&gt;Takealot.com, a leading South African online retailer, is looking for a highly talented &lt;strong&gt;Product Lead &lt;/strong&gt;for our&lt;strong&gt; Dark Store Systems &lt;/strong&gt;to join our team in South Africa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Product Lead&lt;/strong&gt; owns the strategic roadmap and functional requirements for our hyper-local micro-fulfillment network. This role serves as the bridge between operations, commercial teams, and engineering to enable ultra-fast delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mission is to establish the core software foundations for our dark store operations, ensuring seamless inventory movement from our central supply chain right through to the customer&#39;s digital basket, culminating in a frictionless digital handoff to the on-demand delivery fleet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think you’ve been challenged before? Think again!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale&lt;/strong&gt;: Over 4 million happy shoppers shop online on takealot.com and Mr D. Show them what you can do.&lt;/li&gt;
