&lt;p&gt;takealot.com, a leading South African online retailer, is looking for a highly talented&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join our team in Johannesburg.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Takealot’s third-party marketplace business is outpacing the growth of the Retail business and now represents over 20% of all units sold. We are looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account&amp;nbsp;Manager&lt;/strong&gt;: Marketplace to help shape the future of the Takealot Marketplace. The role is focused on driving success for some of the most influential sellers on the platform and leveraging key learning/feedback to improve the Takealot platform that will benefit all sellers. The Strategic Account Manager is responsible for accelerating sales growth, expanding selection on the platform and improving retention among the established key accounts as well as nurturing high potential sellers to grow into future strategic accounts. Key to this role is creating innovative ways to identify growth opportunities, and operational improvement opportunities through partnership with both internal and external stakeholder such as Retail Merchandising, Marketplace Product, Takealot Supply Chain and Takealot Catalogue and Seller executive teams, etc. and improving our overall knowledge of how to succeed as a seller on Takealot Marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position reports to the Head of Marketplace&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Roles &amp;amp; Responsibilities Business Growth Owns all facets of the account management process for high-potential medium to large accounts, develops and maintain strategic relationships with executive members within seller’s management teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands business growth drivers for sellers and how to create an optimal growth path for individual sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes internal resources to help sellers grow and succeed by maximising the benefits sellers gain from all available growth levers, promotions, daily deals, ad campaigns, ATL etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive promotional planning for strategic sellers, build seasonal campaigns and working capital cycles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse key seller metrics to enable the execution of data driven solutions and act on opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses data and analytics to make day-to-day business decisions, to identify underperformance and to nurture upcoming high potential sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thinks beyond individual campaigns and applies knowledge to future plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do deep dives on seller-level issues that hampers growth and deliver recommendations to solve seller problems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds seller-level account targets and collaborate with Divisional Heads to construct the business plans to deliver desired results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document a seller-specific view of the competitive landscape to inform the growth strategy of key sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
